{"id":"n73065-1-13","stage":3,"title":"앞뒤 · 前后","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n73065-1-13-1","ko":"이 가방은 앞뒤가 서로 다른 색으로 된 신상품이에요.","zh":"这个包是最新款，正面和背面是不同颜色的哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"가방은","meaning":"包，背包，提包","explanation":"가방：包，背包，提包；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"가방","audio":"/audio/6852b2954fc8556674f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18259","senseId":"1","lemma":"가방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가방은","audio":"/audio/ace97b45f3b5eaff73f4.mp3"}},{"text":"앞뒤가","meaning":"前后","explanation":"앞뒤：前后；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"앞뒤","audio":"/audio/a2da6ec03bdd3f366f26.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73065","senseId":"1","lemma":"앞뒤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앞뒤가","audio":"/audio/4791f332a4b6e2226db7.mp3"}},{"text":"서로","meaning":"互相，相互","explanation":"서로：互相，相互","readings":[{"term":"서로","audio":"/audio/fbeb53408bcf7039778f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66374","senseId":"1","lemma":"서로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"서로","audio":"/audio/fbeb53408bcf7039778f.mp3"}},{"text":"다른","meaning":"不同，不一致","explanation":"다르다：不同，不一致；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"다르다","audio":"/audio/1db38b4e543bc73e4860.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26824","senseId":"1","lemma":"다르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}},{"text":"색으로","meaning":"色，色彩","explanation":"색：色，色彩；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"색","audio":"/audio/4e0f2a64814ac0cdc90a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20231","senseId":"1","lemma":"색","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"색으로","audio":"/audio/f36b209daf51415c8a7e.mp3"}},{"text":"된","meaning":"做成，用……做","explanation":"되다：做成，用……做；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"9","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"된","audio":"/audio/1c4305152ccc1be2241e.mp3"}},{"text":"신상품이에요.","meaning":"新品，新产品","explanation":"신상품：新品，新产品；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"신상품","audio":"/audio/61c683d98e67184db7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65590","senseId":"1","lemma":"신상품","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"신상품이에요","audio":"/audio/e6b5c7f72693dcdcf0d2.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"6852b2954fc85566","term":"가방","zh":"包，背包，提包","audio":"/audio/6852b2954fc8556674f1.mp3","entryId":"18259","definition":"用来放入物品且可以手提或肩背的东西。","pronunciation":["가방"]},{"id":"a2da6ec03bdd3f36","term":"앞뒤","zh":"前后","audio":"/audio/a2da6ec03bdd3f366f26.mp3","entryId":"73065","definition":"前面和后面。","pronunciation":["압뛰"]},{"id":"fbeb53408bcf7039","term":"서로","zh":"互相，相互","audio":"/audio/fbeb53408bcf7039778f.mp3","entryId":"66374","definition":"两个以上缔结关系的对象相对于各自的对方。","pronunciation":["서로"]},{"id":"1db38b4e543bc73e","term":"다르다","zh":"不同，不一致","audio":"/audio/1db38b4e543bc73e4860.mp3","entryId":"26824","definition":"两个对象相互不一样。","pronunciation":["다르다"]},{"id":"4e0f2a64814ac0cd","term":"색","zh":"色，色彩","audio":"/audio/4e0f2a64814ac0cdc90a.mp3","entryId":"20231","definition":"物体吸收光后表现出的明暗或红、黄、蓝等颜色。","pronunciation":["색"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"做成，用……做","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"由某种材料或成分构成。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"61c683d98e67184d","term":"신상품","zh":"新品，新产品","audio":"/audio/61c683d98e67184db7fd.mp3","entryId":"65590","definition":"新出来的产品。","pronunciation":["신상품"]}],"audio":"/audio/823bd16aa3923a5497ca.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n73065-1-13-2","ko":"정말 그러네요. 앞은 붉은색인데 뒤는 갈색이네요.","zh":"确实是这样。正面是红色的，背面却是棕色的呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"그러네요.","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그러네요","audio":"/audio/f320583a427f5c837556.mp3"}},{"text":"앞은","meaning":"前，前面","explanation":"앞：前，前面；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"5","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앞은","audio":"/audio/d3b074925910df444f24.mp3"}},{"text":"붉은색인데","meaning":"红色","explanation":"붉은색：红色；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"붉은색","audio":"/audio/f7c2f74d48489905e7ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61041","senseId":"1","lemma":"붉은색","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"붉은색인데","audio":"/audio/448f599e7d7ce37fab09.mp3"}},{"text":"뒤는","meaning":"后，后面","explanation":"뒤：后，后面；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"뒤","audio":"/audio/c65326b2de936236c222.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67477","senseId":"1","lemma":"뒤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뒤는","audio":"/audio/66f5a837e1f3b3f5786d.mp3"}},{"text":"갈색이네요.","meaning":"褐色","explanation":"갈색：褐色；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"갈색","audio":"/audio/6c353afe7f9ea283c859.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14752","senseId":"1","lemma":"갈색","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갈색이네요","audio":"/audio/b5ff109eecf7bcd2c346.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"前，前面","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"人体或物体的前面部分。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"f7c2f74d48489905","term":"붉은색","zh":"红色","audio":"/audio/f7c2f74d48489905e7ef.mp3","entryId":"61041","definition":"如同熟透的辣椒或血液的颜色一样浓的赤色。","pronunciation":["불근색"]},{"id":"c65326b2de936236","term":"뒤","zh":"后，后面","audio":"/audio/c65326b2de936236c222.mp3","entryId":"67477","definition":"朝向的反方向。","pronunciation":["뒤ː"]},{"id":"6c353afe7f9ea283","term":"갈색","zh":"褐色","audio":"/audio/6c353afe7f9ea283c859.mp3","entryId":"14752","definition":"像干枯的树叶一样的暗黄色。","pronunciation":["갈쌕"]}],"audio":"/audio/f8a447e0b899fddbdcfc.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.036,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=73065","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":102,"sequenceScore":2.6894,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["确实是这样。正面是红色的，背面却是棕色的呢。","这个包是最新款，正面和背面是不同颜色的哦。","裕敏啊，你是对现在的丈夫一见钟情吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这个包是最新款，正面和背面是不同颜色的哦。","裕敏啊，你是对现在的丈夫一见钟情吗？","确实是这样。正面是红色的，背面却是棕色的呢。"],"answer":2}]}
